    "# Device-Level Analysis: Enriched Solar Panel Experiments\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Abstract\n",
    "This notebook analyzes the experimental outcomes of solar cell devices. We transition from chemical compositions to full device stacks (ETL/HTL) and analyze how acceleration stress (Temperature, Humidity) and architecture (n-i-p vs. p-i-n) impact the standardized stability metric **TS80m**.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Methodology\n",
    "1.  **Metric Selection:** We focus on `stability_ts80m` (Standardized room-temp lifetime) to ensure fair comparison across different lab conditions.\n",
    "2.  **Stress Analysis:** We correlate `acc_temp` and `acc_humidity` with device failure rates.\n",
    "3.  **Architecture Evaluation:** Compare the performance of inverted (p-i-n) and regular (n-i-p) stacks."
   ],
   "id": "intro"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-04-20T10:54:58.688979Z",
     "start_time": "2026-04-20T10:54:58.637749Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "\n",
    "import matplotlib as mpl\n",
    "mpl.rcParams['figure.facecolor'] = 'white'\n",
    "mpl.rcParams['axes.facecolor'] = 'white'\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style=\"white\", palette=\"bright\")\n",
    "\n",
    "df_s = pd.read_parquet('../data/enriched_solar_panels.parquet')\n",
    "print(f\"Loaded {len(df_s)} experimental records.\")"
   ],
   "id": "setup",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Loaded 1264 experimental records.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "execution_count": 1
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Acceleration Stress Analysis\n",
    "Perovskites are sensitive to environment. We analyze the experimental conditions: `acc_temp` (Stress Temperature) and `acc_humidity` (Stress Humidity)."
   ],
   "id": "stress_md"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-04-20T10:54:58.819141Z",
     "start_time": "2026-04-20T10:54:58.701094Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(14, 5), facecolor='white')\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.histplot(df_s['acc_temp'].dropna(), ax=axes[0], color='salmon', kde=True)\n",
    "axes[0].set_title(\"Distribution of Testing Temperatures\")\n",
    "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"Temperature (°C)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.histplot(df_s['acc_humidity'].dropna(), ax=axes[1], color='skyblue', kde=True)\n",
    "axes[1].set_title(\"Distribution of Testing Humidity\")\n",
    "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"Relative Humidity (%)\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ],
   "id": "stress_plot",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1400x500 with 2 Axes>"
      ],
      "image/png": ""
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data",
     "jetTransient": {
