  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Performance vs. Stability Trade-off\n",
    "A major research question: Does high initial efficiency ($PCE$) lead to faster degradation?"
   ],
   "id": "tradeoff_md"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {
    "ExecuteTime": {
     "end_time": "2026-04-20T10:55:36.146203Z",
     "start_time": "2026-04-20T10:55:36.039068Z"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6), facecolor='white')\n",
    "ax = sns.regplot(data=df_s, x='jv_default_pce', y=np.log1p(df_s['stability_ts80m']),\n",
    "                 scatter_kws={'alpha':0.3, 'color':'gray'}, line_kws={'color':'red'})\n",
    "ax.set_facecolor('white')\n",
    "plt.title(\"Efficiency (PCE) vs. Log-Stability (TS80m)\", fontsize=14)\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"Initial Efficiency (%)\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"Log-Standardized Lifetime\")\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ],
   "id": "tradeoff_plot",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
